{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to build, manage, and expand your settlement in Lysoria: The Settlers Path. As the leader, you\u2019ll guide your people through challenges, resource management, and strategic decisions to transform a humble village into a thriving kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings, assign workers, and unlock new technologies as you balance growth, prestige, and happiness. With a rich blend of city-building, strategy, and simulation, Lysoria offers a deep and rewarding experience for fans of thoughtful management games. Can you lead your settlers to prosperity and leave a lasting legacy?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978310?t=1757950476","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978310?t=1757950476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978310/d30fe9456bce73e9266cb09e615e7d2d3714e381/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757950476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978310/d30fe9456bce73e9266cb09e615e7d2d3714e381/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757950476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to build, manage, and expand your settlement in Lysoria: The Settlers Path. As the leader, you\u2019ll guide your people through challenges, resource management, and strategic decisions to transform a humble village into a thriving kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Con